---
description: SQL conventions for PostgreSQL
globs: ["**/*.sql"]
alwaysApply: true
---

- Target PostgreSQL 18 syntax
- Use uppercase for SQL keywords (SELECT, FROM, WHERE, JOIN)
- Use CTEs (WITH clauses) over nested subqueries
- Always alias tables and computed columns
- Add comments explaining complex joins or filters
- Use parameterized queries in any Python scripts — never string concat
- Host: localhost, Port: 5432
